      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The universe may not care, but your struggle is the very thing that gives your life shape and purpose. You are not just prolonging the inevitable; you are creating a story that you can live by. Accepting the stillness is not the same as giving up—it is a choice to keep moving forward, to keep fighting the battle that matters to you. The point is not the outcome, but the act of trying itself.",
